) VALUES (
    'adelboden-venue-guide',
    '{"en": "Adelboden: Switzerland''s Giant Slalom Paradise", "de": "Adelboden: Die Schweizer Riesenslalom-Paradies", "fr": "Adelboden : Le paradis suisse du slalom géant", "it": "Adelboden: Il paradiso svizzero dello slalom gigante", "es": "Adelboden: El paraíso suizo del slalom gigante", "pt": "Adelboden: O paraíso suíço do slalom gigante", "nl": "Adelboden: Zwitserland''s reuzenslalom paradijs", "ar": "أدلبودن: جنة التعرج العملاق السويسرية", "ja": "アーデルボーデン：スイスの大回転パラダイス", "zh": "Adelboden: Ruishi de Dashanzhuan Tiantang", "ko": "아델보덴: 스위스의 대회전 천국"}'::jsonb,
    '{"en": "The Chuenisbärgli course at Adelboden hosts one of the most iconic giant slalom races on the World Cup calendar. Swiss fans create an unforgettable atmosphere.", "de": "Die Chuenisbärgli-Piste in Adelboden ist Gastgeber eines der ikonischsten Riesenslalom-Rennen im Weltcup-Kalender.", "fr": "La piste du Chuenisbärgli à Adelboden accueille l''une des courses de slalom géant les plus emblématiques du calendrier de la Coupe du monde.", "it": "La pista del Chuenisbärgli ad Adelboden ospita una delle gare di slalom gigante più iconiche del calendario di Coppa del Mondo.", "es": "La pista Chuenisbärgli en Adelboden alberga una de las carreras de slalom gigante más icónicas del calendario de la Copa del Mundo.", "pt": "A pista Chuenisbärgli em Adelboden sedia uma das corridas de slalom gigante mais icônicas do calendário da Copa do Mundo.", "nl": "De Chuenisbärgli piste in Adelboden organiseert een van de meest iconische reuzenslalom races op de Wereldbeker kalender.", "ar": "يستضيف مسار تشوينسبيرغلي في أدلبودن واحدة من أكثر سباقات التعرج العملاق شهرة في تقويم كأس العالم", "ja": "アーデルボーデンのチュエニスベルグリコースは、ワールドカップカレンダーで最も象徴的な大回転レースの一つを開催しています。", "zh": "Adelboden de Chuenisbaergli saidao juxing Shijie Bei rilicheng zhong zui juyou biaozhixing de dashanzhuan bisai zhiyi.", "ko": "아델보덴의 휘니스베르글리 코스는 월드컵 캘린더에서 가장 상징적인 대회전 레이스 중 하나를 개최합니다."}'::jsonb,
    '{"en": "<p>Adelboden''s Chuenisbärgli giant slalom is one of the crown jewels of the World Cup <a href=\"/alpine-skiing-guide/\">alpine skiing</a> calendar. This Swiss venue combines challenging racing with passionate spectators and stunning Bernese Oberland scenery.</p><h2>The Chuenisbärgli</h2><p>The giant slalom course is famous for its steep, icy sections and demanding rhythm changes. Athletes must combine pure edge grip with tactical gate line selection to succeed on this mountain.</p><p>The lower section, visible to the huge crowds in the finish area, creates dramatic racing as athletes push to maintain speed through challenging terrain.</p><h2>Swiss Skiing Culture</h2><p>Switzerland has a deep connection to alpine skiing, and Adelboden represents one of the most beloved stops on the circuit. Local fans turn out in enormous numbers, creating an atmosphere that rivals any venue in the sport.</p><p>Champions like <a href=\"/marco-schwarz-profile/\">Marco Schwarz</a>, <a href=\"/henrik-kristoffersen-profile/\">Henrik Kristoffersen</a>, and <a href=\"/manuel-feller-profile/\">Manuel Feller</a> have battled on this legendary slope.</p><h2>The Weekend</h2><p>Adelboden typically hosts both giant slalom and slalom races, testing athletes across the full range of technical skiing skills. The double-header weekend draws huge crowds from across Switzerland and beyond.</p><h2>Village Atmosphere</h2><p>The traditional Swiss mountain village of Adelboden offers charming accommodation, excellent restaurants, and a genuine Alpine experience. The après-ski scene during race weekends is vibrant and welcoming.</p><h2>Location</h2><p>Adelboden is located in the Bernese Oberland, about 60 km south of Bern. The mountain setting provides spectacular views of the surrounding peaks.</p><h2>Getting There</h2><p>The venue is accessible from Bern or Zurich airports, followed by train and bus connections. Swiss public transport makes the journey comfortable and scenic.</p>", "de": "<p>Der Riesenslalom am Chuenisbärgli in Adelboden ist eines der Kronjuwelen des Weltcup-<a href=\"/alpine-skiing-guide/\">Ski Alpins</a>. Dieser Schweizer Austragungsort verbindet anspruchsvolles Racing mit leidenschaftlichen Zuschauern und atemberaubender Berner Oberland-Landschaft.</p><h2>Der Chuenisbärgli</h2><p>Die Riesenslalom-Strecke ist berühmt für ihre steilen, eisigen Abschnitte und anspruchsvollen Rhythmuswechsel.</p><h2>Schweizer Skikultur</h2><p>Champions wie <a href=\"/marco-schwarz-profile/\">Marco Schwarz</a> und <a href=\"/manuel-feller-profile/\">Manuel Feller</a> haben auf diesem legendären Hang gekämpft.</p><h2>Dorfsatmosphäre</h2><p>Das traditionelle Schweizer Bergdorf Adelboden bietet charmante Unterkünfte und ausgezeichnete Restaurants.</p>", "fr": "<p>Le slalom géant du Chuenisbärgli à Adelboden est l''un des joyaux de la couronne du calendrier de la Coupe du monde de <a href=\"/alpine-skiing-guide/\">ski alpin</a>. Ce site suisse combine des courses exigeantes avec des spectateurs passionnés.</p><h2>Le Chuenisbärgli</h2><p>Le parcours de slalom géant est célèbre pour ses sections raides et glacées.</p><h2>Culture du ski suisse</h2><p>Des champions comme <a href=\"/marco-schwarz-profile/\">Marco Schwarz</a> et <a href=\"/manuel-feller-profile/\">Manuel Feller</a> se sont affrontés sur cette pente légendaire.</p>", "it": "<p>Lo slalom gigante del Chuenisbärgli ad Adelboden è uno dei gioielli della corona del calendario di Coppa del Mondo di <a href=\"/alpine-skiing-guide/\">sci alpino</a>. Questa sede svizzera combina gare impegnative con spettatori appassionati.</p><h2>Il Chuenisbärgli</h2><p>Il percorso di slalom gigante è famoso per le sue sezioni ripide e ghiacciate.</p><h2>Cultura dello sci svizzero</h2><p>Campioni come <a href=\"/marco-schwarz-profile/\">Marco Schwarz</a> hanno combattuto su questa pendenza leggendaria.</p>", "es": "<p>El slalom gigante del Chuenisbärgli en Adelboden es una de las joyas de la corona del calendario de la Copa del Mundo de <a href=\"/alpine-skiing-guide/\">esquí alpino</a>. Este lugar suizo combina carreras exigentes con espectadores apasionados.</p><h2>El Chuenisbärgli</h2><p>El recorrido de slalom gigante es famoso por sus secciones empinadas y heladas.</p>", "pt": "<p>O slalom gigante do Chuenisbärgli em Adelboden é uma das joias da coroa do calendário da Copa do Mundo de <a href=\"/alpine-skiing-guide/\">esqui alpino</a>. Este local suíço combina corridas desafiadoras com espectadores apaixonados.</p><h2>O Chuenisbärgli</h2><p>O percurso de slalom gigante é famoso por suas seções íngremes e geladas.</p>", "nl": "<p>De reuzenslalom op de Chuenisbärgli in Adelboden is een van de kroonjuwelen van de Wereldbeker <a href=\"/alpine-skiing-guide/\">alpine skiën</a> kalender. Deze Zwitserse locatie combineert uitdagende races met gepassioneerde toeschouwers.</p><h2>De Chuenisbärgli</h2><p>Het reuzenslalomparcours is beroemd om zijn steile, ijzige secties.</p>", "ar": "<p>يعد التعرج العملاق على تشوينسبيرغلي في أدلبودن أحد جواهر تاج تقويم كأس العالم <a href=\"/alpine-skiing-guide/\">للتزلج الألبي</a>. يجمع هذا الموقع السويسري بين السباقات الصعبة والمشجعين المتحمسين.</p><h2>تشوينسبيرغلي</h2><p>مسار التعرج العملاق مشهور بأقسامه الشديدة الانحدار والجليدية.</p>", "ja": "<p>アーデルボーデンのチュエニスベルグリ大回転は、ワールドカップ<a href=\"/alpine-skiing-guide/\">アルペンスキー</a>カレンダーの宝石の一つです。このスイスの会場は、チャレンジングなレースと情熱的な観客を兼ね備えています。</p><h2>チュエニスベルグリ</h2><p>大回転コースは、急で氷のセクションで有名です。</p>", "zh": "<p>Adelboden de Chuenisbaergli dashanzhuan shi Shijie Bei <a href=\"/alpine-skiing-guide/\">gaoshan huaxue</a> rilicheng de zhongyao xiangmu zhiyi. Zhe ge Ruishi changguan jiehe le tiaozhanxing bisai he reqing guanzhong.</p><h2>Chuenisbaergli</h2><p>Dashanzhuan saidao yi qi douqiao de bingxue luduan erwen ming.</p>", "ko": "<p>아델보덴의 휘니스베르글리 대회전은 월드컵 <a href=\"/alpine-skiing-guide/\">알파인 스키</a> 캘린더의 보석 중 하나입니다. 이 스위스 경기장은 도전적인 레이스와 열정적인 관중을 결합합니다.</p><h2>휘니스베르글리</h2><p>대회전 코스는 가파르고 얼음 같은 구간으로 유명합니다.</p>"}'::jsonb,
    'venue-guide',
    'AS',
    '{"en": "Adelboden venue guide - Home of the iconic Chuenisbärgli giant slalom in the Swiss Bernese Oberland with passionate crowds and challenging technical terrain.", "de": "Adelboden Venue Guide - Heimat des ikonischen Chuenisbärgli-Riesenslaloms im Berner Oberland.", "fr": "Guide du site d''Adelboden - Terre du slalom géant emblématique du Chuenisbärgli dans l''Oberland bernois.", "it": "Guida alla sede di Adelboden - Casa dell''iconico slalom gigante del Chuenisbärgli nell''Oberland bernese.", "es": "Guía del lugar de Adelboden - Hogar del icónico slalom gigante del Chuenisbärgli en el Oberland bernés.", "pt": "Guia do local de Adelboden - Lar do icônico slalom gigante do Chuenisbärgli no Oberland bernês.", "nl": "Adelboden locatiegids - Thuis van de iconische Chuenisbärgli reuzenslalom in het Berner Oberland.", "ar": "دليل موقع أدلبودن - موطن التعرج العملاق الأيقوني على تشوينسبيرغلي في أوبرلاند برن", "ja": "アーデルボーデン会場ガイド - スイスのベルナーオーバーラントにある象徴的なチュエニスベルグリ大回転の本拠地", "zh": "Adelboden changguan zhinan - Ruishi Baen Oberland de biaozhixing Chuenisbaergli dashanzhuan de jiayuan", "ko": "아델보덴 경기장 가이드 - 스위스 베르네 오버란트의 상징적인 휘니스베르글리 대회전의 본거지"}'::jsonb,
